            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This supplementary data support the article “Stakeholder engagement in noise action<br>planning mediated by OGITO – an Open Geospatial Interactive TOol” that has been recently accepted<br>for publication in the Journal of Urban Technology (https://www.tandfonline.com/journals/cjut20).<br>The data consist of three appendices as follows:<br>- Appendix A - List of user stories and associated tasks for a Noise Action Planning (NAP)<br>workshop. User stories were collected during an online workshop with professional<br>participants.<br>- Appendix C - Glossary. List of technical terms used in the manuscript associated. It facilitates<br>understanding the full article.<br>- Appendix D - Short description of German terms used in the tool. The tool described in the<br>manuscript presents a list of German terms that non- german speakers might find difficult to<br>understand. This appendix briefly describes those terms.</p>"
                }
              },
              {
